#: src/MainWindow.vala:32
#, c-format
msgid "Set up %s"
msgstr "%s saz bike"

#: src/Views/AbstractOnboardingView.vala:84
msgid "Next"
msgstr "Pêş"

#: src/Views/AbstractOnboardingView.vala:103
msgid "Skip All"
msgstr "Hemûyan derbas bike"

#: src/Views/AbstractOnboardingView.vala:106
msgid "Back"
msgstr "Vegere"

#: src/Views/AbstractOnboardingView.vala:111
msgid "Get Started"
msgstr "Dest pê bike"

#: src/Views/AppCenterView.vala:22
msgid ""
"Get the apps you need on AppCenter or sideload Flatpak apps from alternative "
"stores."
msgstr ""
"Sepanên ku ji te re pêdivî ne ji Navenda sepanan bistîne yan jî sepanên "
"Flatpak ji markêtên alternatîv bar bike."

#: src/Views/AppCenterView.vala:24
msgid "Get Some Apps"
msgstr "Hinek sepanan bistîne"

#: src/Views/AppCenterView.vala:33
msgid "Get apps made for elementary OS and reviewed by elementary on AppCenter"
msgstr ""
"Sepanên ku ji bo elementary OS hatine çêkirin û ji aliyê elementary ve "
"hatine nirxandin ji Navenda sepanan bistîne"

#: src/Views/AppCenterView.vala:51
msgid "Sideload apps from alternative app stores like Flathub"
msgstr "Sepanan ji markêtên alternatîv ên wekî Flathub bar bike"

#: src/Views/EarlyAccessView.vala:13
#, c-format
msgid ""
"Only use this pre-release version of %s on devices dedicated for development."
msgstr ""
"Vê guhertoya pêş-weşandî ya %s tenê li ser amûrên ji bo pêşvebirinê "
"veqetandî bi kar bîne."

#: src/Views/EarlyAccessView.vala:15
msgid "Early Access Build"
msgstr "Avakirina gihîştina zû"

#: src/Views/EarlyAccessView.vala:22
msgid "You will not be able to upgrade to a stable release"
msgstr "Tu yê nikaribî rojanekirinê bikî ji bo weşaneke cîgir"

#: src/Views/EarlyAccessView.vala:28
msgid "Some features may be missing or incomplete"
msgstr "Dibe ku hinek taybetmendî kêm an wendayî yan kêm bin"

#: src/Views/EarlyAccessView.vala:34
msgid "Report issues using the Feedback app"
msgstr "Bi bikaranîna sepana paşragihandinê pirsgirêkan ragihîne"

#: src/Views/FinishView.vala:22
#, c-format
msgid ""
"Enjoy using %s! You can always visit System Settings to set up hardware or "
"change your preferences."
msgstr ""
"Ji bikaranîna %s şahiyê bigire! Tu dikarî her dem serdana Sazkariyên pergalê "
"bikî ji bo sazkirina reqalavê yan jî guhertina vebijêrkên xwe."

#: src/Views/FinishView.vala:24
msgid "Ready to Go"
msgstr "Amade ye"

#: src/Views/FinishView.vala:30
msgid "From the Applications menu or by searching for specific settings"
msgstr "Ji menuya sepanan an jî bi lêgerîna li sazkariyên diyarkirî"

#: src/Views/FinishView.vala:35
msgid "From the Quick Settings menu or by middle-clicking toggle buttons"
msgstr ""
"Ji menuya sazkariyên lezgîn an jî bi tikandina navîn a bişkokên guhertinê"

#: src/Views/FinishView.vala:40
msgid "By secondary-clicking on the wallpaper"
msgstr "Bi tikandina duyemîn a li ser wêneya dîwêr"

#: src/Views/GuestView.vala:10
msgid "This temporary session will be reset when you log out."
msgstr "Dema tu derkevî ev danişîna demkî wê were vegerandina rewşa bingehîn."

#: src/Views/GuestView.vala:12
msgid "Guest Session"
msgstr "Danişîna mêvan"

#: src/Views/GuestView.vala:19
msgid "All data created during this session will be deleted"
msgstr "Hemû daneyên ku di vê danişînê de hatine afirandin wê werin jêbirin"

#: src/Views/GuestView.vala:25
msgid "Settings will be reset to defaults"
msgstr "Sazkarî wê li yên berdest werin vegerandin"

#: src/Views/GuestView.vala:31
msgid "Save files on an external device to access them later"
msgstr "Ji bo ku paşê xwe bigihînî wan, pelan li ser amûreke derveyî tomar bike"

#: src/Views/HouseKeepingView.vala:22
#, c-format
msgid ""
"Old files can be automatically deleted after %u day to save space and help "
"protect your privacy."
msgid_plural ""
"Old files can be automatically deleted after %u days to save space and help "
"protect your privacy."
msgstr[0] ""
"Ji bo tomarkirina cîh û parastina taybetiya te, pelên kevn piştî %u roj "
"xweber dikarin werin jêbirin."
msgstr[1] ""
"Ji bo tomarkirina cîh û parastina taybetiya te, pelên kevn piştî %u rojan "
"xweber dikarin werin jêbirin."

#: src/Views/HouseKeepingView.vala:33
msgid "Housekeeping"
msgstr "Rêkûpêkkirin"

#: src/Views/HouseKeepingView.vala:38 src/Views/HouseKeepingView.vala:48
#: src/Views/HouseKeepingView.vala:64 src/Views/HouseKeepingView.vala:80
#: src/Views/HouseKeepingView.vala:96
msgid "Automatically Delete"
msgstr "Xweber jê bibe"

#: src/Views/HouseKeepingView.vala:40
msgid "Old temporary files"
msgstr "Pelên demkî yên kevn"

#: src/Views/HouseKeepingView.vala:56
msgid "Downloaded files"
msgstr "Pelên daxistî"

#: src/Views/HouseKeepingView.vala:72
msgid "Screenshot files"
msgstr "Pelên wêneya dîmenderê"

#: src/Views/HouseKeepingView.vala:88
msgid "Trashed files"
msgstr "Pelên jêbirdankê"

#: src/Views/NightLightView.vala:22
msgid ""
"Make the colors of your display warmer at night to help prevent eye strain "
"and sleeplessness."
msgstr ""
"Bi şev rengên dîmendera xwe germtir bike da ku pêşî li westandina çavan û "
"bêxewiyê bigirî."

#: src/Views/NightLightView.vala:24
msgid "Night Light"
msgstr "Ronahiya şevê"

#: src/Views/NightLightView.vala:34
msgid "Night Light:"
msgstr "Ronahiya şevê:"

#: src/Views/NightLightView.vala:40
msgid "Adjust schedule and temperature…"
msgstr "Bername û germahiyê saz bike…"

#: src/Views/OnlineAccountsView.vala:24
msgid ""
"Use Mail, Calendar, and Tasks with an existing online account to sync "
"emails, events, and tasks with this device."
msgstr ""
"Ename, salname û erkê bi jimarekî serhêl ê heyî re bi kar bîne da ku e-name, "
"bûyer û erkan bi vê amûrê re hevdem bikî."

#: src/Views/OnlineAccountsView.vala:26
msgid "Online Accounts"
msgstr "Jimarên serhêl"

#: src/Views/OnlineAccountsView.vala:31
msgid "Connect Online Accounts…"
msgstr "Jimarên serhêl girê bide…"

#: src/Views/StyleView.vala:72
msgid ""
"Make it your own by choosing a visual style and accent color. Apps may "
"override these with their own look."
msgstr ""
"Bi hilbijartina şêwazeke dîtbarî û rengê balkêşiyê, wê ji xwe re kesane "
"bike. Sepan dikarin van bi xuyanga te ya taybet derbas bikin."

#: src/Views/StyleView.vala:74
msgid "Choose Your Look"
msgstr "Xuyanga xwe hilbijêre"

#: src/Views/StyleView.vala:113
msgid "Default"
msgstr "Berdest"

#: src/Views/StyleView.vala:122 src/Views/StyleView.vala:143
